{
  "name": "Magical Sabotage",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following Cunning Strike options.</p><ul><li><strong>Spell Susceptibility (Cost: 2d6).</strong> The target has Disadvantage on the next Saving Throw it makes against a spell until the start of your next turn.</li><li><strong>Steal Resistance (Cost: 2d6).</strong> Choose one kind of damage. If the target has Resistance to that kind of damage, until the start of your next turn, the target loses that Resistance and you gain Resistance to that damage type.</li></ul>",
